{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:16:10Z","created_by_operation":"op_d47e310f15ec489b8af635ca1a01101d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_06d45a14fed620bd53d45cae89b944e2e1cdc1f39454601f4b0b650b62e04084","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"phnx-labs/agi-cli@148a9795a4cd snapshot ac41ecdac71c4c24","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_8042a8533cc8b380cdd9de522835080de49e011dee13c131615fc03dea83bff8","slc_a6bc2d6cd0503f71bcde93088c4e5afe72b53aedaf381ad2ce9e51a90c10c82c"],"source_ids":["src_e87cc4e1fbe65a77931ceb13adb020ef"],"text":"Live sessions resolve to states such as working, waiting_input, idle, orphaned, crashed, closed, abandoned, queued, or unknown, with matching filter flags that imply --active; orphan/crashed detection reads tmux attached-client counts and editor registry heartbeats.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:16:10Z","updated_by_operation":"op_d47e310f15ec489b8af635ca1a01101d"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:16:10Z","created_by_operation":"op_d47e310f15ec489b8af635ca1a01101d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_2277423d17abfcd40e73d697f5790786e8ae5f4f8ae11f9fbeecad002c266c2d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"phnx-labs/agi-cli@148a9795a4cd snapshot ac41ecdac71c4c24","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_3872722ff7ec083a189aa8e3408565148292c5b8778363350325c96bda33117f"],"source_ids":["src_e87cc4e1fbe65a77931ceb13adb020ef"],"text":"`agents insights perf` reads a disposable SQLite warehouse at ~/.agents/.cache/perf/perf.db containing hook, command, and run timing rollups, which is deletable at any time.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:16:10Z","updated_by_operation":"op_d47e310f15ec489b8af635ca1a01101d"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:16:10Z","created_by_operation":"op_d47e310f15ec489b8af635ca1a01101d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_262aa291f15cf8ddb3e49e8d7215f6e7eba6cac128dcc65d3e37178fc6ca0f7c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"phnx-labs/agi-cli@148a9795a4cd snapshot ac41ecdac71c4c24","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0ed7adac49056ef6d8c5efa3144d8354e9f3fcedbb3d4aebfb03042ecd2c6ea3"],"source_ids":["src_e87cc4e1fbe65a77931ceb13adb020ef"],"text":"Setup clones the phnx-labs/.agents-system system repo into ~/.agents/.system, fast-forwarding from its verified canonical origin on `agents use`; AGENTS_SYSTEM_REPO can point to a user fork and --no-system-repo skips the clone.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:16:10Z","updated_by_operation":"op_d47e310f15ec489b8af635ca1a01101d"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:16:10Z","created_by_operation":"op_d47e310f15ec489b8af635ca1a01101d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_6dc73b37960686f3cac7653b1d72a3d010894506e82acdcfde7a642b5371e502","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"phnx-labs/agi-cli@148a9795a4cd snapshot ac41ecdac71c4c24","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_ba131f787b9c749e488ae51b1cfebefff53682044dc2020e98a764c9076f738f","slc_d49949f5b3ddf871fadbaea556978063f51abed68d3f4ab0da0ca4df2425cd7b","slc_e32fe89ab68d32f88d1f1f3c856eb94c352ca5219f26d3ad4c41624f03845aaa"],"source_ids":["src_e87cc4e1fbe65a77931ceb13adb020ef"],"text":"`agents run` supports a rate-limit fallback chain (--fallback codex,antigravity) and account-selection strategies such as --strategy balanced that spread work across accounts and exclude session-limited accounts until their stated reset time.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:16:10Z","updated_by_operation":"op_d47e310f15ec489b8af635ca1a01101d"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:16:10Z","created_by_operation":"op_d47e310f15ec489b8af635ca1a01101d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_8c1b762845dcc0815d082e9e8dc7ef2adef776b465ec937c12fa331fb27ac701","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"phnx-labs/agi-cli@148a9795a4cd snapshot ac41ecdac71c4c24","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_4eb06da81086406715012d5205a0e55c6bda4be29fb642cd4b68037eeb25dd4a","slc_b01025e96ff14d0d20b217c40e65888fe2a312e78c1b227ae427e475fff9f65f"],"source_ids":["src_e87cc4e1fbe65a77931ceb13adb020ef"],"text":"`agents run auto` picks across device, harness, and account layers, excluding harnesses whose accounts are all rate-limited or signed out, and exits nonzero naming the earliest reset when nothing is healthy.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:16:10Z","updated_by_operation":"op_d47e310f15ec489b8af635ca1a01101d"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:16:10Z","created_by_operation":"op_d47e310f15ec489b8af635ca1a01101d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_9b5b78e79aff9ea25a37ee323cc7931c149e6c4eccc044b6e01b5a51f14e5d87","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"phnx-labs/agi-cli@148a9795a4cd snapshot ac41ecdac71c4c24","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_dd64be1b603870fcd9f7a3875a98228fee4afc9f121f2592f306c90eec5b55cb"],"source_ids":["src_e87cc4e1fbe65a77931ceb13adb020ef"],"text":"Session search is backed by a SQLite + FTS5 index at ~/.agents/.history/sessions/sessions.db with incremental scanning; tool queries read SQLite only, with no embeddings, vector database, or model calls.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:16:10Z","updated_by_operation":"op_d47e310f15ec489b8af635ca1a01101d"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:16:10Z","created_by_operation":"op_d47e310f15ec489b8af635ca1a01101d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_a421735020fdb4ff2089c3396bab41eac97494f091ad0232a197eb4dc3a2bf6d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"phnx-labs/agi-cli@148a9795a4cd snapshot ac41ecdac71c4c24","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_59669e261e01aadd5f88a42b3ea80615d5b40f8e17be2dfcb3047ac18d27504e","slc_c42c53c52645adf3976d0ce3437002335c2ce2cf9092075918a93ba6a94e1eeb","slc_d0c30bcd270712a4aa48d8da7e0551106e71a6ee00b6aae15d4221dc9e9c08c6"],"source_ids":["src_e87cc4e1fbe65a77931ceb13adb020ef"],"text":"In direct-exec runs, `--mode skip` forwards each harness's native bypass flag (e.g. --dangerously-skip-permissions for Claude Code, --yolo for Gemini); under `--acp`, skip is granted at the ACP protocol layer by selecting allow_always or the first offered permission option.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:16:10Z","updated_by_operation":"op_d47e310f15ec489b8af635ca1a01101d"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:16:10Z","created_by_operation":"op_d47e310f15ec489b8af635ca1a01101d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_a6966c28799b1a0bc1df7098808278d7c4916b61f7dc321ba187434690bc8642","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"phnx-labs/agi-cli@148a9795a4cd snapshot ac41ecdac71c4c24","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_b81f9d6970ae770b63014471bed7fd69080215287f9ad0fe8d597ea387a6c10b","slc_c96428df3ef8947a4c5e13f2598bff0c9aad136708359e33eeb1265be67356b3","slc_f02ffc823efa6002fa9f2aba3b489f91cae7ef20d67ea51b9fc3c31b0c88eb09"],"source_ids":["src_e87cc4e1fbe65a77931ceb13adb020ef"],"text":"With `--acp`, runs route through the Agent Client Protocol to emit a typed event stream (agent_message_chunk, tool_call, plan_update, stop_reason) instead of raw stdout; ACP adapters are documented for claude, codex, cursor, opencode, openclaw, and grok.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:16:10Z","updated_by_operation":"op_d47e310f15ec489b8af635ca1a01101d"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:16:10Z","created_by_operation":"op_d47e310f15ec489b8af635ca1a01101d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c00d2a3ea46b0eb46bcc6973501f4451abc115b46d4547fc330361f92a935c1f","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"phnx-labs/agi-cli@148a9795a4cd snapshot ac41ecdac71c4c24","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_a78340659bc0b7c1ee9735f0a113abf8ccd2c896665e18e146e60810165560c0"],"source_ids":["src_e87cc4e1fbe65a77931ceb13adb020ef"],"text":"Codex runs use managed permission profiles: edit and auto share a sandbox with writable workspace, ~/.agents, and caches plus network access, differing only in approvals; explicit plan mode keeps the filesystem read-only, and skip removes the sandbox entirely.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:16:10Z","updated_by_operation":"op_d47e310f15ec489b8af635ca1a01101d"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:16:10Z","created_by_operation":"op_d47e310f15ec489b8af635ca1a01101d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c0edd4472903aa72c670e24edf0e783f0f29465e976bc4851647d378b57370af","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"phnx-labs/agi-cli@148a9795a4cd snapshot ac41ecdac71c4c24","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_18e7384038a0ded52150975beb8db0c896d1649864111203e64a7e221fa4e865","slc_8340c9421099c0cf921deeae0405a5e14d49e7c0f8ed4ea9453242839acc5ca5","slc_d89efae0c01fed82107a7bf7a167e811581c9d00f3a23d79fcefa41565441c2c"],"source_ids":["src_e87cc4e1fbe65a77931ceb13adb020ef"],"text":"`agents watchdog` detects stalled sessions, resolves the exact terminal split (tmux, iTerm, VSCodium, or raw pty), and injects a nudge; it is dry-run by default, with a device-local daemon pass every three minutes and in-place account rotation on hard limits.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:16:10Z","updated_by_operation":"op_d47e310f15ec489b8af635ca1a01101d"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:16:10Z","created_by_operation":"op_d47e310f15ec489b8af635ca1a01101d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_e8f39358ed2621db76a6c499a2ab855120caa08e6f3d366f92c29f1e7a00e609","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"phnx-labs/agi-cli@148a9795a4cd snapshot ac41ecdac71c4c24","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_34c63d3f4d2aea86d55ba144d9c6da8d8bc75c428cf56e22afaf65ece28fcb24","slc_4bcd9d0a1f4bf07822107122467fe796411eeaa66f0bf5c49acf4b08c55427f1","slc_ab648190bd99e219c6f14d01401b85ddaccba8fd92b6735ef1309ef14080be8d"],"source_ids":["src_e87cc4e1fbe65a77931ceb13adb020ef"],"text":"`agents run <harness> \"task\"` dispatches work to harnesses such as claude, codex, and antigravity, with modes (plan/edit/auto/skip), JSON output, timeouts, and Unix-pipeline chaining of agents.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:16:10Z","updated_by_operation":"op_d47e310f15ec489b8af635ca1a01101d"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:16:10Z","created_by_operation":"op_d47e310f15ec489b8af635ca1a01101d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_fefc74ec51495c7c19803e4618b5ade4c8752b530f08a2ad356842769127ae15","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"phnx-labs/agi-cli@148a9795a4cd snapshot ac41ecdac71c4c24","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1e89613b767e0289faf8956dc6253f47395e84020c12451f3dbf8b34ee4a30de","slc_87b6f423be01858c784de9cbba02c1f4e71247245516ea2efd3176019e2c14f6","slc_d8f8022caecb968b38c484c339c859909026d8e43f5406caa10cd16a558a2a10"],"source_ids":["src_e87cc4e1fbe65a77931ceb13adb020ef"],"text":"The CLI is installed as @phnx-labs/agents-cli via npm (or bun, or a curl one-liner) and every command works under both the `agents` and `ag` aliases.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:16:10Z","updated_by_operation":"op_d47e310f15ec489b8af635ca1a01101d"}
